<title>USA: Acorn to sell automotive retail unit.</title>
<headline>Acorn to sell automotive retail unit.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSONVILLE, Fla. 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Acorn Venture Capital Corp said Monday it had agreed to sell the assets of its Automotive Industries Inc unit to Morgan Tire &amp; Auto Inc.</p>
<p>Morgan Tire, a Florida-based tire and auto dealer, will also assume certain of Automotive Industries's liabilites, Acorn said.</p>
<p>It said it expects to close the deal within the next 30 days. Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>((--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
